         {
          "text": "This was a build issue in Mulgara, addressed in version 2.0.7.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "The trunk now (r7918) includes version 2.0.8, which additionally includes XA 1.1 support.",
