  "description": "<p>Ben O'Steen reported on the users list that the rebuilder was failing with a ClassNotFoundException against his remote instance of Mulgara.</p>\n\n<p>mulgara-core-2.0.6.jar is missing the client-rdf package (org.mulgara.client.jrdf), which was present prior to 2.0.5. Need to fix this upstream and rebuild mulgara-core. Trippi will also require the updated mulgara-core package.</p>",
